<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43794" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">septunx</span></b> , uncis, m.
		septem-uncia; cf. <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 171</span></i>
			Müll.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>seven twelfths</i> of
			a whole (v. as, 1.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jugeri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					5, 1, 11</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Liv. 5, 24, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auri,</span>”
				<i>seven ounces</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					23, 19, 16</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>seven things of a
				kind</i>, <i>seven pieces</i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hence, in drinking,</span>”
				<i>seven cups</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 8, 51, 25</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3, 82,
		29</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
